# Files Vercel must not upload.
#
# bridge/ is the Bun-only backend. It cannot run on Vercel (the free-tier gate
# refuses Node's TLS fingerprint) and its package.json declares a Bun entry
# ("main": "server.js", "engines": { "bun": ... }), which makes Vercel try to
# build it as a Bun function:
#
#   Invalid export found in module "/var/task/bridge/server.cjs".
#   The default export must be a function or server.
#
# The deployed dashboard talks to a bridge running elsewhere via BRIDGE_URL, so
# the folder is dead weight here.
bridge/

# Local tooling and docs - not needed to serve the dashboard or /v1 proxy.
legacy/
test/
scripts/
.github/
llms.txt
llms-full.txt
README.md
.env
.env.example
zen-proxy.json
free-models.json
*.log

# Vercel uploads the git dir too; it is never part of the deployment.
.git/
